Consider the method below, which is intended to return the maximum value in the array arr.

public static int findMax(int[] arr) {
    int max = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
        if (arr[i] > max) {
            max = arr[i];
        }
    }
    return max;
}

